		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Aquatic, dog-faced gremlin with lobster claws. Allergic to sunlight, dwells under water.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 10, <strong>HP</strong> 1, <strong>ATK</strong> 1 claw -1 (1d4) or congeal water, <strong>MV</strong> near (swim), <strong>S</strong> -2, <strong>D</strong> +0, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> -1, <strong>W</strong> +0, <strong>Ch</strong> -1, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 0</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Congeal Water</strong>. 1/day, manifest a close-sized bubble of water within near for 3 rounds. Water appears around an object or part of a creature. Quenches flames, causes drowning.</p><p></p><p><strong>Sunlight Allergy</strong>. Takes 1d6 damage per round in direct sunlight.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
